@startuml
title APT-SD-D11 Android-First Hardened Terminal Posture
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Preferred field terminal reference posture" {
  component "Android-first hardened terminal" as Android
  component "Workflow core\nweb-based where appropriate" as Core
  component "Native shell / container boundary" as Shell
  component "Native bridge boundary\nconcept only" as Bridge
  component "Peripheral boundaries\nscanner / camera / printer / cash drawer" as Peripherals
  component "Kiosk / lockdown concept" as Kiosk
  component "Device identity and trust" as Trust
  component "Minimal local storage\nnon-authoritative" as Storage
}

package "Eligible fixed station variant" {
  component "Browser/PWA or desktop-compatible station\nonly with equivalent controls" as Fixed
}

Android --> Core
Android --> Shell
Shell --> Bridge
Bridge --> Peripherals
Android --> Kiosk
Android --> Trust
Android --> Storage
Fixed --> Trust : equivalent controls required
Fixed --> Core : possible workflow core reuse

note bottom
Android-first means preferred field-terminal reference posture.
It is not exclusive for every deployment and is not an implementation package design.
end note
@enduml
